sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant API as QuotesController
    participant H as CreateQuoteHandler
    participant P as Pricing
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/quotes (Idempotency-Key: K, body B)
    API->>H: CreateQuoteCommand
    H->>H: validate shape, hash = SHA-256(normalise(B))
    H->>DB: find idempotency key (adviser, K)
    alt key seen, same hash
        DB-->>H: original quote id
        H-->>C: 201 original quote, Idempotent-Replayed: true
    else key seen, different hash
        H-->>C: 422 Idempotency.KeyReused
    else new key
        H->>P: price(client, product)
        P-->>H: premium + factors, or a pricing error (400)
        H->>DB: next Q-year-number from sequence
        H->>H: Quote.Create (raises QuoteCreated)
        H->>DB: one transaction: quote + history + idempotency key + outbox event
        alt a concurrent identical request committed first
            DB-->>H: unique violation on (adviser, K)
            H-->>C: 201 the winner's quote, Idempotent-Replayed: true
        else
            H-->>C: 201 new quote + Location + X-Trace-Id
        end
    end
